{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13594","headline":"巴岭荅杜二见忆 · 严武","name":"巴岭荅杜二见忆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卧向巴山落月时，两乡千里梦相思。\n可但步兵偏爱酒，也知光禄最能诗。\n江头赤叶枫愁客，篱外黄花菊对谁。\n跂马望君非一度，冷猨秋鴈不胜悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严武","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《杜诗详注》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/杜詩詳註_(四庫全書本)）"}